# The repository ignores *.csv and *.png globally. The experiment reports in
# here reference specific figures and tables, so a committed report would point
# at missing files. Un-ignore exactly those, and nothing else: the bulk per-assay
# dumps stay out and are regenerated by the run_*.py scripts.
!**/fig*.png
!**/summary_grid.csv
!**/per_assay_grid.csv
!**/per_pair.csv
